Skills: {{ $('Set Benchmark Params').item.json.skills }}

India Salary Data:
{{ $('Research India Salaries').item.json.choices[0].message.content }}

Global Salary Data:
{{ $('Research Global Salaries').item.json.choices[0].message.content }}

